/div></div><div class="c xa6 y224 w3a h58"><div class="t m0 x25 h7 ybe ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">ciebie </div></div><div class="c x10a y224 w33 h58"><div class="t m0 xbf hb y398 ff2 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls1d ws0">wy<span class="ls0"> </span></div></div><div class="c x20 y224 w38 h58"><div class="t m0 xc0 h7 ybe ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">was </div></div><div class="c x23 y52d w2f h62"><div class="t m0 x3d hb y1fb ff2 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls3 ws0">on<span class="ls0"> </span></div></div><div class="c xbc y52e w39 h94"><div class="t m0 x14 ha y52f ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">go </div></div><div class="c xa6 y52e w3b h94"><div class="t m0 x7b h7 y52f ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">jego </div></div><div class="c xbe y52e w3c h94"><div class="t m0 x16 ha y52f ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">n<span class="ff2">iego </span></div></div><div class="c x10a y52d w33 h62"><div class="t m0 xbf hb y1fb ff2 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls3 ws0">oni<span class="ls0"> </span></div></div><div class="c x20 y530 w3d h95"><div class="t m0 x1a h7 y531 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">ich </div></div><div class="c x97 y530 w3e h95"><div class="t m0 x1b ha y531 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">n<span class="ff2">ich </span></div></div><div class="c x23 y52e w2f h62"><div class="t m0 x3d hb y1fb ff2 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls3 ws0">ono<span class="ls0"> </span></div></div><div class="c x10a y530 w33 h96"><div class="t m0 xbf hb y532 ff2 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls3 ws0">one<span class="ls0"> </span></div></div><div class="c x23 y530 w2f h36"><div class="t m0 x3d hb y1c5 ff2 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls3 ws0">ona<span class="ls0"> </span></div></div><div class="c xbc y530 w36 h36"><div class="t m0 x1a h7 y6e ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">- </div></div><div class="c xa6 y530 w3f h36"><div class="t m0 x14 h7 y6e ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">jej </div></div><div class="c xbe y530 w3c h36"><div class="t m0 x74 ha y6e ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">n<span class="ff2">iej </span></div></div><div class="c x0 y0 w3 h5"><div class="t m0 x7 ha y533 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">UWAGI! <span class="ff3">Niektóre polskie </span>zaimki osobowe<span class="ff2"> <span class="ff3">mają w dopełniaczu </span></span>2-3 formy<span class="ff2">:</span> </div><div class="t m0 xa1 ha y534 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls9 ws0">A.<span class="ff2 ls0"> <span class="_ _9"></span><span class="ff7">Krótka</span> <span class="_ _b"></span><span class="ff4">forma</span> <span class="_ _9"></span><span class="ff3">zaimków <span class="_ _9"></span><span class="ff9 ls5">ty</span><span class="ff5"> <span class="_ _b"></span><span class="ff6">(cię), <span class="_ _4"></span><span class="ff9">on<span class="_ _4"></span></span></span></span></span> <span class="_ _9"></span><span class="ff5">(go) <span class="_ _9"></span></span><span class="ls5">i <span class="_ _b"></span></span><span class="ff9">ono<span class="ff5"> <span class="_ _9"></span>(go) <span class="_ _9"></span><span class="ff3">występuje <span class="_ _b"></span>czę<span class="_ _7"></span>sto. <span class="_ _b"></span>Zwykle <span class="_ _9"></span>to <span class="_ _b"></span>bywa, <span class="_ _9"></span>kiedy </span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y535 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">zaimek stoi <span class="ff7">na końcu </span><span class="ls6">czy</span><span class="ff4"> <span class="ff7">w środku<span class="_ _4"></span> zdania</span> </span>(<span class="ff6">Nie widzę <span class="ffb">cię<span class="ff5">! Szukam <span class="ff9">go<span class="ff4"> </span></span>od dawna)</span></span></span>. </div><div class="t m0 xa1 ha y536 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls2 ws0">B.<span class="ff2 ls0"> <span class="ff7">Pełna</span> <span class="ff4">forma</span> <span class="ff3">zaimków <span class="ff9 ls5">ty</span><span class="ff5"> (ciebie), <span class="ff9">on</span></span></span> <span class="ff5">(jego) </span><span class="ls5">i </span><span class="ff9">ono<span class="ff5"> (jego)</span></span> <span class="ff3">występuje rzadko. </span>To bywa, kiedy: </span></div><div class="t m0 x6e ha y537 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1. zaimek stoi <span class="ff7">na początku zdania</span> (<span class="ff9">Ciebie<span class="ff5"> <span class="ff6">nie widzę. Czy </span></span>jego <span class="ff5">szukasz?</span></span><span class="lsa">),<span class="_ _4"></span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x6e ha y538 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2. zaimek stoi <span class="ff4">po przyimku </span>(<span class="ff5">Jestem</span> <span class="ff5">obok <span class="ff9">ciebie</span>! Co zrobisz dla <span class="ff9">niego</span>?</span><span class="lsa">),</span> </div><div class="t m0 x6e ha y539 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3. na zaimku jest <span class="ff4">akcent emocjonalny</span> (<span class="ff6">Nie widzę <span class="ff5">tylko <span class="ff9">ciebie</span>!</span></span> <span class="ff5">Szukam tylko <span class="ff9">jego</span>!</span>) </div><div class="t m0 xa1 ha y53a ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">C. Forma po przyimku<span class="ff2"> jest specyficzna (przedrostek </span>n-<span class="ff3">) dla zaimków 3<span class="ff2">-ej osoby:  </span></span></div><div class="t m0 xa1 ha y53b ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">     on<span class="ff2"> <span class="ff5">(od </span></span>n<span class="ff5">iego)<span class="ff2"> <span class="ls5">i </span></span></span>ono<span class="ff5"> (od </span>n<span class="ff5">iego), </span>ona<span class="ff5"> (do </span>n<span class="ff5">iej)</span>;<span class="ff5"> </span>oni<span class="ff2"> <span class="ff5">(dla </span></span>n<span class="ff5">ich) <span class="ff2 ls5">i </span></span>one<span class="ff5"> (dla </span>n<span class="ff5">ich).<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y53c ff7 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4. Proszę zaznaczyć poprawny<span class="ff4"> wariant (zaimki osobowe). </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y53d ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">WZÓR: <span class="ff5">Nie znam <span class="ff9">go <span class="ls5">/ </span>jego <span class="ls5">/ </span>niego</span>.<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div></div><div class="c x10 y51b wb1 h97"><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y136 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff4 ls5">Go<span class="ls0"> </span>/ <span class="ls0">Jego </span>/ <span class="ls0">Niego </span></span></span>tu nie ma.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y137 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Oni nie mogą bez <span class="ff4">go <span class="ls5">/ </span>jego <span class="ls5">/ </span>niego</span></span></span>.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y138 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Ona nigdy nie mówi do <span class="ff4 ls11">ja<span class="ls0"> <span class="ls5">/ </span><span class="ff7">mną</span> <span class="ls5">/ </span>mnie</span></span></span></span>.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y82 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Idę do <span class="ff7 lsa">ją</span><span class="ff4"> <span class="ls5">/ </span>jej <span class="ls5">/ </span>niej</span></span></span>.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y6e ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span></span>Nigdzie <span class="ff7 lsa">ją</span><span class="ff4"> <span class="ls5">/ </span>jej <span class="ls5">/ </span>niej <span class="ff3">nie widzę </span></span> </div></div><div class="c x3 y51b w56 h97"><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y136 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span></span>Nie kocham <span class="ff7">cię<span class="ff4"> <span class="ls5">/ </span>ciebie <span class="ls5">/ </span>tobie</span></span>.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y137 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Ale nie mogę bez <span class="ff7">cię<span class="ff4"> <span class="ls5">/ </span>ciebie <span class="ls5">/ </span>tobie</span></span></span></span>.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y138 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">8.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Nie poznałam <span class="ff4">go <span class="ls5">/ </span>jego <span class="ls5">/ </span>niego</span></span></span>.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y82 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">9.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Nie lubię <span class="ff4 ls8">ni<span class="ls6">ch<span class="ls0"> <span class="ls5">/ </span>ich <span class="ls5">/ <span class="lse">im</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.  </div><div class="t m0 x74 h10 y6e ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">10.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _7"></span><span class="ff2">Nic nie zrobimy dla <span class="ff4">nich <span class="ls5">/ </span>ich <span class="ls5">/ <span class="lse">im<span class="_ _4"></span></span></span></span>. </span></span></div></div><div class="c x0 y0 w3 h5"><div class="t m0 x7 ha y53e ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">5. <span class="ff7">Proszę uzupełnić zdania</span> (zaimki osobowe). </div><div class="t m0 x7 h7 y53f ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">WZÓR:<span class="ff2"> <span class="ff5">Znam <span class="ffb">cię</span> <span class="ff6">(ty) od samego dzieciństwa.</span></span> </span></div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y540 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span></span>Gdzie jest Antek? Szukam ................. (on) od ponad godziny. </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y541 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span></span>Andrzeju, czy ten prezent jest od <span class="ff3">................. (ty)? Dziękuję ci bardzo.</span> </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y30a ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Twoja wnuczka Kasia jest fantastyczna. Zazdroszczę ................. (ona).</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y40b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Oprócz ................. (wy) wszyscy przyszli na moje prz<span class="_ _c"></span>yjęcie urodzinowe.<span class="_ _4"></span><span class="ff2"> </span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y542 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Język polski to ulubiony przedmiot Kasi w szkole. Uczy się </span></span>................. (on) od roku. </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y543 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">To jest schronisko dla zwierząt. Obok ................. (ono) znajduje się sklep zoologiczny.</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y544 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">To dom moich dziadków. Byłem u ................. (oni) dwa tygodnie temu.</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y545 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">8.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Przyjdziemy na pewno. Spodziewajcie się ................. (my) około godziny siedemnastej.</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y546 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">9.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Pawle, dlaczego twój pies zawsze się ................. (ja) boi?</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x9b h10 y547 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">10.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _7"></span><span class="ff3">Zwierzęta lubią moje towarzystwo. Lubię do ................. (one) jeździć.<span class="ff2"> </span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y548 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">6. <span class="ff7">Proszę uzupełnić zdania według wzoru (zaimki osobowe)</span>. </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y1b5 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Proszę, to prezent dla</span></span> <span class="ff9">ciebie</span><span class="lsa">! </span><span class="ff3">–</span> <span class="ff3">Naprawdę?! Dla ................... ? Tak się cieszę!</span> </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y549 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Nie lubię Emilii! –</span></span> <span class="ff3">Jak możesz tak mówić, przecież ................... nie znasz!</span> </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y1c6 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Proszę, to adres dobrego okulisty. Musisz iść do ................... jak najszybc<span class="_ _c"></span>iej.<span class="_ _4"></span><span class="ff2"> </span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y54a ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Zapraszamy was jutro na kolację. –</span></span> <span class="ff3">Świetnie! Przyjdziemy do ................... koło siódmej.</span> </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y54b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Nie byliście jeszcze u ...................</span></span>? <span class="ff3">Musicie zobaczyć nasze nowe mieszkanie.</span> </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y54c ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Nie lubię ................... odwiedzać. Są tacy zarozumiali.</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y54d ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span></span>Nie <span class="ff3">widziałaś swoich koleżanek już dawno. Musisz do ...................</span> <span class="ff3">zadzwonić.</span> </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y54e ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">8.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Nie możemy do ................... przyjść. Nie będzie ci przykro?</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y54f ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">9.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Proszę, musisz do ................... napisać. Będę<span class="_ _c"></span> się o ciebie martwić.<span class="ff2"> </span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x106 h10 y550 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">10.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_"> </span><span class="ff3">Wykład </span></span>tego profesora <span class="ff3">był interesując</span>y<span class="ff3">. Słuchaliśmy .................. bardzo uważnie.</span> <span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="fc4 sc0"> </span></div></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
